'''Punish the Lewd''' (変態紳士に天罰を, ''Hentai Shinshi ni Tenbatsu O'', '''Divine Punishment to the Lewd Gentleman''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Resistant" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

